						</span>


					</footer><!-- /.entry-meta -->
				</article><!-- /#post-62 -->
				<article id="post-60" class="post-60 post type-post status-publish format-standard hentry category-shopping tag-online-shopping tag-shopping">
					<header class="entry-header">

							<div class="entry-thumbnail">
<span class="entry-date-comments">
	<a href="http://marjorierodrigues.com/?m=20120815">
	<span class="date-box">
		<span class="date">15</span>
		<span class="month">Aug</span>
	</span>
	</a>
	<span class="comments-box">
	</span>
</span>
								<div class="entry-thumb-img">
									<a href="http://marjorierodrigues.com/?p=60"><img src="http://marjorierodrigues.com/wp-content/themes/creator/AIT/Framework/Libs/timthumb/timthumb.php?src=http://marjorierodrigues.com/wp-content/uploads/2012/08/online-store.jpg&w=200&h=180" alt="" /></a>
								</div>
							</div>
							<h2 class="entry-title"><a href="http://marjorierodrigues.com/?p=60" title="Permalink to Saving Money While Shopping Online" rel="bookmark">Saving Money While Shopping Online</a></h2>
<span class="by-author">
	<span class="sep"> by </span>
	<span class="author vcard">
		<a class="url fn n" href="http://marjorierodrigues.com/?author=1" title="View all posts by admin" rel="author">admin</a>
	</span>
</span>

					</header><!-- .entry-header -->

					<div class="entry-content">
						<p>Everyone who likes to store usually wants to get the finest discount rates when it arrives to their purchasing, even those who are purchasing on the web. You really should constantly consider to get the bare minimum cost for your merchandise so here are a couple of suggestions that will aid you accomplish that just by utilizing your buddies and social community.</p>
<p>For mass discount rates, the finest way to get very low cost items is to pair up with a buddy. Why not share the price cut on your Facebook account and question people who would want to be part of in. Mass discount rates are usually items that are marketed for much considerably less for each merchandise in a bundle, so if you purchase a couple of more pieces you will spend considerably less than you would usually spend. This is great for consumable items or factors that you use usually. But even if you don&#8217;t need to have that large sum of items, you can still pair up with buddies and make confident that you get that large price cut.&nbsp;</p>
<p>An additional way to get particular provides is usually by utilizing the Facebook site of the on the web stores. If you &#8220;Like&#8221; the site, you will acquire notifications each time they post some thing. A great deal of stores supply discount rates for their Facebook buddies and they give them coupons on announce promotional codes on their wall. So you have to frequently check their Facebook site in buy to get as numerous discount rates as you can, especially if you store there usually. You can also share the price cut to advertise the web site a little bit as it will aid them get more customers and most likely reduced their costs.</p>
<p>Companion internet sites are also an amazing way to help save income when purchasing on the web from your preferred web site. If you pick to purchase some thing from a web site and that web site has a partner web site the place you get a certain price cut, you can use that price cut later on to help save a great deal of income. The good thing is that you can get truly good discount rates when it arrives to partner web site and if it has merchandise that you need to have or you want to purchase, you are certainly in luck.&nbsp;</p>

					</div><!-- .entry-content -->

					<footer class="entry-meta">
						<span class="cat-links">
							<span class="entry-utility-prep entry-utility-prep-cat-links">Posted in</span>
							<a href="http://marjorierodrigues.com/?cat=1" title="View all posts in Shopping" rel="category">Shopping</a>
						</span>

						<span class="tag-links">
							<span class="entry-utility-prep entry-utility-prep-tag-links">Tagged</span>
							<a href="http://marjorierodrigues.com/?tag=online-shopping" rel="tag">Online Shopping</a>, <a href="http://marjorierodrigues.com/?tag=shopping" rel="tag">Shopping</a>
						</span>


					</footer><!-- /.entry-meta -->
				</article><!-- /#post-60 -->
				<article id="post-16" class="post-16 post type-post status-publish format-standard hentry category-shopping">
					<header class="entry-header">

							<div class="entry-thumbnail">
<span class="entry-date-comments">
	<a href="http://marjorierodrigues.com/?m=20120221">
	<span class="date-box">
		<span class="date">21</span>
		<span class="month">Feb</span>
	</span>
	</a>
	<span class="comments-box">
		<div class="comments-link">
			<a href="http://marjorierodrigues.com/?p=16#comments">0</a>
		</div>
	</span>
</span>
								<div class="entry-thumb-img">
									<a href="http://marjorierodrigues.com/?p=16"><img src="http://marjorierodrigues.com/wp-content/themes/creator/AIT/Framework/Libs/timthumb/timthumb.php?src=http://marjorierodrigues.com/wp-content/uploads/2012/02/colt_range.jpg&w=200&h=180" alt="" /></a>
								</div>
							</div>
							<h2 class="entry-title"><a href="http://marjorierodrigues.com/?p=16" title="Permalink to Breitling Colt" rel="bookmark">Breitling Colt</a></h2>
<span class="by-author">
	<span class="sep"> by </span>
	<span class="author vcard">
		<a class="url fn n" href="http://marjorierodrigues.com/?author=1" title="View all posts by admin" rel="author">admin</a>
	</span>
</span>

					</header><!-- .entry-header -->

					<div class="entry-content">
						<p>Watches such as the Breitling Colt are very appreciated for their flawless design and sturdy build. This beautiful watch is easily recognized by the shape of the bezel and by its sturdy construction. The Colt uses an electronic movement that is said to be ten times more accurate than any other standard quartz movement and it is mostly designed for racing. The sporty style which is used from Breitling, designed for aviation use, is perfectly copied by amatory replicas.</p>
<p><a href="http://amatorywatches.co/">Amatory store</a> is available online for a wide variety of Breitling models that have become legends over a long history of watch making. Even if these amatory watches are not originals, this doesn’t mean that they can’t offer the same imposing style brought by Breitling and that they don’t look amazing. Also, amatory store stands behind every model sold and guarantees that the quality will be nothing less than perfect.</p>
<p>The Breitling Colt Chronograph II is a professional watch that displays a 1/10<sup>th</sup> of a second and also has an easily changeable time zone. It is a watch meant for pilots that fly for long distances and need to know the time in two different time zones; this can be adjusted without having to move the seconds or minutes hands. Amatory watches that have the Colt name on the case offer the same functions and precise movements found in the original Breitling watches.</p>
<p><a href="http://amatorywatches.co/category/watches/breitling/">Replica Breitling</a> Colt is a unique watch thanks to its style. Various copies of this model are available online but not all are perfect, this is why finding the right store is important. Amatory watches can satisfy every need for fashion and style and as the Breitling Colt, every amatory watch is unique thanks to its high quality and good build. The Breitling Colt Collection also includes a model for women that keeps the same style in essence but has a few changes done.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>

					</div><!-- .entry-content -->

					<footer class="entry-meta">
						<span class="cat-links">
							<span class="entry-utility-prep entry-utility-prep-cat-links">Posted in</span>
							<a href="http://marjorierodrigues.com/?cat=1" title="View all posts in Shopping" rel="category">Shopping</a>
						</span>



					</footer><!-- /.entry-meta -->
				</article><!-- /#post-16 -->
				<article id="post-12" class="post-12 post type-post status-publish format-standard hentry category-shopping">
					<header class="entry-header">

							<div class="entry-thumbnail">
<span class="entry-date-comments">
	<a href="http://marjorierodrigues.com/?m=20120210">
	<span class="date-box">
		<span class="date">10</span>
		<span class="month">Feb</span>
	</span>
	</a>
	<span class="comments-box">
		<div class="comments-link">
			<a href="http://marjorierodrigues.com/?p=12#comments">1</a>
		</div>
	</span>
</span>
								<div class="entry-thumb-img">
									<a href="http://marjorierodrigues.com/?p=12"><img src="http://marjorierodrigues.com/wp-content/themes/creator/AIT/Framework/Libs/timthumb/timthumb.php?src=http://marjorierodrigues.com/wp-content/uploads/2012/02/word-cloud.jpg&w=200&h=180" alt="" /></a>
								</div>
							</div>
							<h2 class="entry-title"><a href="http://marjorierodrigues.com/?p=12" title="Permalink to Online Shopping and Brand Loyalty" rel="bookmark">Online Shopping and Brand Loyalty</a></h2>
<span class="by-author">
	<span class="sep"> by </span>
	<span class="author vcard">
		<a class="url fn n" href="http://marjorierodrigues.com/?author=1" title="View all posts by admin" rel="author">admin</a>
	</span>
</span>

					</header><!-- .entry-header -->

					<div class="entry-content">
						<p>Brand loyalty seems to be higher when shopping online than when going through traditional brick and mortar stores, but not with all types of products. Thus, it plays an important role when shopping for clothes and leather goods, but it is less important when high tech devices are the focus of the online acquisition. Indeed, the internet is generally chosen as the purchase channel for its wider spectrum of deals searching. High tech devices as a main online shopping sector benefit from precise and updated price comparators. Moreover, these items are easier to be objectively compared as manufacturers and retailers provide customers with detailed descriptions of their features and functionalities. </p>
<p> <a href="http://marjorierodrigues.com/?p=12#more-12" class="more-link">(more&#8230;)</a></p>

					</div><!-- .entry-content -->

					<footer class="entry-meta">
						<span class="cat-links">
							<span class="entry-utility-prep entry-utility-prep-cat-links">Posted in</span>
							<a href="http://marjorierodrigues.com/?cat=1" title="View all posts in Shopping" rel="category">Shopping</a>
						</span>



					</footer><!-- /.entry-meta -->
				</article><!-- /#post-12 -->
				<article id="post-5" class="post-5 post type-post status-publish format-standard hentry category-shopping">
					<header class="entry-header">

							<div class="entry-thumbnail">
<span class="entry-date-comments">
	<a href="http://marjorierodrigues.com/?m=20120210">
	<span class="date-box">
		<span class="date">10</span>
		<span class="month">Feb</span>
	</span>
	</a>
	<span class="comments-box">
		<div class="comments-link">
			<a href="http://marjorierodrigues.com/?p=5#comments">2</a>
		</div>
	</span>
</span>
								<div class="entry-thumb-img">
									<a href="http://marjorierodrigues.com/?p=5"><img src="http://marjorierodrigues.com/wp-content/themes/creator/AIT/Framework/Libs/timthumb/timthumb.php?src=http://marjorierodrigues.com/wp-content/uploads/2012/02/Online-Shopping.jpg&w=200&h=180" alt="" /></a>
								</div>
							</div>
							<h2 class="entry-title"><a href="http://marjorierodrigues.com/?p=5" title="Permalink to Is the Internet a Way to Avoid Shopping?" rel="bookmark">Is the Internet a Way to Avoid Shopping?</a></h2>
<span class="by-author">
	<span class="sep"> by </span>
	<span class="author vcard">
		<a class="url fn n" href="http://marjorierodrigues.com/?author=1" title="View all posts by admin" rel="author">admin</a>
	</span>
</span>

					</header><!-- .entry-header -->

					<div class="entry-content">
						<p>Can we say that online purchasers are people who basically do not like the idea of shopping? While 36% of those who buy online at least once a month say that they avoid as much as possible to go into stores because shopping is a chore for them. However, this behavior is far from a majority. Studies conducted have shown that 63% of online customers consider that shopping can be a real pleasure for them. They state that the Internet is a complementary sales channel that provides them with more comfort when it comes to purchasing certain products or with new opportunities to consume.<br />
 <a href="http://marjorierodrigues.com/?p=5#more-5" class="more-link">(more&#8230;)</a></p>

					</div><!-- .entry-content -->

					<footer class="entry-meta">
						<span class="cat-links">
							<span class="entry-utility-prep entry-utility-prep-cat-links">Posted in</span>
							<a href="http://marjorierodrigues.com/?cat=1" title="View all posts in Shopping" rel="category">Shopping</a>
						</span>



					</footer><!-- /.entry-meta -->
				</article><!-- /#post-5 -->
				</section>


		</div><!-- end of content-wrapper -->
