<div id="text-3" class="box widget-container widget_text"><div class="box-wrapper"><h2 class="widget-title">About me</h2>			<div class="textwidget"><p>My blog is created to drive you through the world of online shopping. I will teach you the way to choose brands, shops, ways of payment/shipping and differents details in this huge “world” .
</p><p>
I have a big experience buying online, because I’m too lazy to go walk hours in markets searching for something, and it happens that I can come back without it. Online shopping is the best choice.<br/>
</p><p>
You have to be very careful who you give you personal details. There are a lot of SCAM sites that want to steal you credit card info or simply receive your payment and don’t send you nothing.</p></div>
